{"text": "When people are close to each other, under the same roof, they are bound to rub each other the wrong way. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Without proper conflict resolution, children are bound to disconnect from their parents, especially in their teens. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As parents, we are also tasked with several roles we have to play in the life of our children including disciplinarian in chief. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sometimes, depending on how we handle different situations, it might conflict with our childs wishes or desires, which might alienate them from us. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In such cases, they may find it easier to open up to a relative or a close family friend than to their parent. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> This is why a community village was vitally important such that when a child felt they were not getting a fair shake from their parents, they would approach a close relative who would steer them in the right direction and, in most cases, back into the arms of their parents.", "alignment": {"characters": ["W", "h", "e", "n", " ", "p", "e", "o", "p", "l", "e", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "c", "l", "o", "s", "e", " ", "t", "o", " ", "e", "a", "c", "h", " ", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", ",", " ", "u", "n", "d", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "m", "e", " ", "r", "o", "o", "f", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", "y", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "b", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "r", "u", "b", " ", "e", "a", "c", "h", " ", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "r", "o", "n", "g", " ", "w", "a", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "i", "t", "h", "o", "u", "t", " ", "p", "r", "o", "p", "e", "r", " ", "c", "o", "n", "f", "l", "i", "c", "t", " ", "r", "e", "s", "o", "l", "u", "t", "i", "o", "n", ",", " ", "c", "h", "i", "l", "d", "r", "e", "n", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "b", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "d", "i", "s", "c", "o